WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.745
Question one: answer A. Raw readings not yet interpreted are best called data.

00:00:05.745 --> 00:00:12.817
Question two: answer B. Ballot, tally, display — the flow matches I P O: input, process, output.

00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:20.404
Question three: answer D. A stall layout plan is decoration only — not an information-system component.

00:00:20.404 --> 00:00:24.676
Question four: answer A. A rain sensor is an input device.

00:00:24.676 --> 00:00:31.968
Question five: answer C. Information literacy means check author, date, and sources before judging.
